    "title": "Mighty Networks",
    "description": "Mighty is where creators, entrepreneurs, and brands build their own digital communities, courses, and memberships with cultural software.\r\n\r\nEvery day millions of members contribute to cultural networks across Mighty, going deeper in their own rich, immersive communities for interests, passions, career, health, wellness, and more.  \r\n\r\nAnyone can host a Mighty Network where you can livestream, run events, set up fun and lively chats, offer online courses, charge for membership, and so much more. \r\n\r\nWhat makes Mighty different is that it\u2019s your brand. You are designing and scaling your own content, courses, commerce, and community into your very own digital culture. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a member of one or more Mighty Networks or a host building your own\u2014when you\u2019re #OnMighty, you\u2019re a part of building the next generation of new, fresh, and exciting digital cultures.  \r\n\r\n\u201cCompared to anything else, it's like playing 3D chess vs. checkers. Nothing comes close.\u201d - Randy Kavanaugh, Mighty Host\r\n\r\n\u201cI have 3 paid courses with over 120 students. I started everything in 2 weeks. I could not have done it with Mighty Networks!\u201d - Pablo Riboldi, Mighty Host\r\n\r\n\"I am in awe of the AMAZINGNESS that is cultural software. It\u2019s beautiful, functional, enjoyable, and ntuitive. I am zipping along at lightning speed!\" - Jennifer Joffe, Mighty Host\r\n\r\n\u201cMy Mighty Network is incredibly dynamic and keeps getting better. The features they offer make it easy to build a community and, more importantly, keep my members engaged.  Their team is also highly responsive, another reason I love Mighty. In short, A+\u201d - Dana Wilde, Mighty Host\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nSome Mighty Networks have monthly and/or yearly subscription plans available.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: mn.co/terms_of_use",
